<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, viewport-fit=cover">
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#f8fafc">
    <title>데일리 루틴 트래커 | Daily Routine Tracker</title>
    <meta name="description" content="오늘의 루틴을 추가하고 체크하며 완료율을 한눈에 확인하는 심플한 데일리 루틴 트래커.">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link
        href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800&family=Noto+Sans+KR:wght@400;500;700&display=swap"
        rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css">
</head>

<body>
    <div class="bg-blobs" aria-hidden="true">
        <span class="blob blob-1"></span>
        <span class="blob blob-2"></span>
    </div>

    <main class="container">
        <!-- 헤더: 날짜 + 완료율 -->
        <header class="card header-card">
            <div class="header-top">
                <div>
                    <p class="eyebrow" id="weekday-label">TODAY</p>
                    <h1 class="date-title" id="date-title">--</h1>
                </div>
                <div class="percent-badge" id="percent-badge">
                    <span id="percent-value">0</span><small>%</small>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="progress" role="progressbar" aria-label="오늘의 완료율" aria-valuemin="0" aria-valuemax="100"
                aria-valuenow="0" id="progress-bar">
                <div class="progress-fill" id="progress-fill"></div>
            </div>

            <div class="header-meta">
                <span id="progress-text">0 / 0 완료</span>
                <span id="progress-message">루틴을 추가해 하루를 시작해 보세요 ✨</span>
            </div>

            <!-- 최근 7일 기록 -->
            <div class="week" id="week-history" aria-label="최근 7일 완료율"></div>
        </header>

        <!-- 입력창 -->
        <section class="card" aria-labelledby="add-title">
            <h2 class="sr-only" id="add-title">루틴 추가</h2>
            <form class="add-form" id="add-form" autocomplete="off">
                <input type="text" id="task-input" class="input" placeholder="새로운 루틴을 입력하세요 (예: 물 2L 마시기)"
                    maxlength="80" required>
                <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary" id="add-btn">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"
                        stroke-linecap="round">
                        <path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14" />
                    </svg>
                    <span>추가</span>
                </button>
            </form>
        </section>

        <!-- 체크리스트 -->
        <section class="card list-card" aria-labelledby="list-title">
            <div class="list-head">
                <h2 class="list-title" id="list-title">오늘의 체크리스트</h2>
                <div class="filters" role="tablist">
                    <button class="filter active" data-filter="all" id="filter-all">전체</button>
                    <button class="filter" data-filter="active" id="filter-active">진행중</button>
                    <button class="filter" data-filter="done" id="filter-done">완료</button>
                </div>
            </div>

            <ul class="task-list" id="task-list"></ul>

            <div class="empty" id="empty-state" hidden>
                <div class="empty-icon">📝</div>
                <p class="empty-title">아직 루틴이 없어요</p>
                <p class="empty-desc">위 입력창에서 첫 번째 루틴을 추가해 보세요.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="list-foot">
                <span id="remaining-text">남은 루틴 0개</span>
                <button class="btn-link" id="reset-today-btn">오늘 체크 초기화</button>
            </div>
        </section>

        <footer class="footnote">
            더블클릭으로 수정 · 체크 상태는 매일 자정에 자동 초기화되며 데이터는 브라우저에 저장됩니다.
        </footer>
    </main>

    <script src="app.js"></script>
</body>

</html>
